      <TableCell>key is the label key that the selector applies to.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>operator</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>operator represents a key’s relationship to a set of values. Valid operators are In, NotIn, Exists and DoesNotExist.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>values</code></TableCell>
